# Login-shell setup, sourced once per login before .zshrc.
#
# macOS note: Terminal.app starts every new tab as a login shell, so this runs
# constantly there - but NOT in tmux panes or `ssh host cmd`. Anything that must
# always be present belongs in .zshenv instead.

# The Homebrew shellenv probe lived here, but .zprofile only runs for LOGIN
# shells: not tmux panes, not `exec zsh`, not `ssh host cmd`. That left brew
# (and every brew-installed tool that rc.d guards on) missing from those
# shells. It now lives in .zshenv, which runs for every invocation.
